msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫………?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_30BA81B2_E88F_4371_B721_F454315186DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b09ac4f943727cc725cabbf0f57ec54861b060e4b6f4542443d4e6cb55ba3f28
#. default-sha256: e5400bc7f02b3e179c326402ad523cf9f8269a7ade2237f6b2c86b84aacc6aea
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30BA81B2_E88F_4371_B721_F454315186DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(I was always the one with nothing to offer,⟪k:2⟫powerless to be of anyone’s help...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(……나는 모든 걸 잃은 인간이야.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ 누군가가 의지할 자조차 아니었지……)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E5CF6BA9_138D_49E3_9CB8_FC80B4880C15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c8d876a20a87c66f7b0557f177d11f343909fe38fc750c53fd115d9913bffff
#. default-sha256: bed5c672139c0d7eeb3885d4eceed44221532cfa2cb66e62104c31f0c6eaff5b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E5CF6BA9_138D_49E3_9CB8_FC80B4880C15"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(So if anything’s motivating me,⟪k:1⟫it’s not concern for the boy,)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(그래서 ⟪k:1⟫가만 못 두겠단 선의가 아니라――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ 이런 나라도 뭐가 가능하다면……)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BD7747DE_86D3_46FC_AFE1_6BF62A19A690
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38d43012ae1646bea531ee23cd652af335c516aaeb556160139854da601bf5df
#. default-sha256: 0e00be534864eb51b7eb8969329b05ab8327e497547c6c9cd2447f54b27d4714
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BD7747DE_86D3_46FC_AFE1_6BF62A19A690"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It didn’t take much arm-twisting to get him to give us a room, so who knows, maybe "
"he’ll come over to our side easier than either of us expect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그래도 ⟪k:3⟫이렇게 방까지 마련해 줬으니⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫생각보다 빠르게 협력해 주지 않을까"
"요?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5E712CB4_EEA8_4836_804D_C91839E58BA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77c84d1c5f43100b8285aafde20912ce1f335ec969288d2be6915654128a2da9
#. default-sha256: 9acac06d178f045d3f10c5cc3dd85d2142355272fa7326950235217f8146d898
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5E712CB4_EEA8_4836_804D_C91839E58BA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He doesn’t trust me, but he also doesn’t know enough about me to decide what to do "
"yet. ⟪k:3⟫He needs time, and doing this gives him that time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫하지만 아직 ⟪k:3⟫제가 어떤 자인지는 모르죠.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫제 정체를 살필 시간이 필요한 "
"겁니다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_773302FC_AD94_4149_BACB_EAB20C88C142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 599ce3235dcf5ef5d65d524b6b6345e3ac29ca4e98d8a9f9665be2cec9f20892
#. default-sha256: 3dbe0004bb6cc14de0d68e1aa042133bccd7676546d20158550f5cdbf8da3d67
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_773302FC_AD94_4149_BACB_EAB20C88C142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he decides keeping me around is not to his advantage, he will act accordingly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫제가 해로운 자로 판단되면――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫멜도 수를 쓸걸요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7EB3B130_8F81_43CA_9175_9451787DAAF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6db2c2187b37d0e780db80a442ccfa41d343eee6bd5090a1b63cb1e7e308449
#. default-sha256: 85dd952e6b9799562a0188b3f7c64e43d95c283c2dcfbdc4fcfde07bc8d51222
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7EB3B130_8F81_43CA_9175_9451787DAAF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I don’t think he has the spine for it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그럴 배짱은 ⟪k:3⟫없을 것 같은데요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_83225998_CFAD_4684_8752_ADB0FCF8A1FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96dfda7e2bafe458e892ee0e0c5f67afac71e1f2cea0e8c7634ae92b566164a5
#. default-sha256: d0d602de98824b4a0d57414766c2ed47a943aa3bb09133386831627620204c23
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_83225998_CFAD_4684_8752_ADB0FCF8A1FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Did you ever have a chance... ⟪k:3⟫to see the shadows trapped in the mansion?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그대는…… ⟪k:3⟫그 저택에서 세 남자의 그림자를 못 만났습니까?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AB0BAADD_89E6_44F7_93C5_40473ED2B1D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98b47739608d80ad1041dd9a1b6edbf493e1a7df6941d88e688ae0ffd70dd658
#. default-sha256: bffad9ecbdc794252424fe41af43355d0d62ad614aa85cdfd5586249ce7499ae
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AB0BAADD_89E6_44F7_93C5_40473ED2B1D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I... ⟪k:3⟫I might have.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫But around the time Hayden Rhodes passed away..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫본 것도―― 같아요. ⟪k:3⟫하지만…… ⟪k:4⟫저는……⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫헤이든 로즈가 타계한 시기를 기"
"점으로……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c83af286d73527f2eec76c798e5a18fdda83f03899343e3697490f595be58e6
#. default-sha256: fd5258761d7a8b4f41df2742e6b8c31736eff64babcfea58456a6b10edec74ef
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had become... ⟪k:3⟫merely another part of the cursed mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……그때는…… ⟪k:3⟫저도 ⟪k:4⟫저주받은 저택의――⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫일부에 불과했던 것 같아요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 423a2e576fc014e5ccdddc8c205e968692594da21df295313eb3cbc718e11d48
#. default-sha256: e4f982e83a082107cf71b064ab99b49600f41e20bee6260e53c534c5230d1d3a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I suppose, much like the rules differ between the realms of the living and the dead, ⟪k:1⟫"
"so too do they differ for those who have lost their grip on reality.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(산 자와 죽은 자의 세계가 다르듯이……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ 이성과 광기의 경계가 있을 수도 있겠군……)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ca69c0852136987e3b38629dc564895b5a5a3678fa13075b32387742d77bd3c
#. default-sha256: 9c8a9eb0950a95447fb1352d6d737ebd1f2ee53836c680b5e388d60f7abf53bc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone else is holding the reins.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫My first guess would be the lord, but "
"regardless..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫주모자는 다른 사람…… 상식적으로 보면 영주겠는데……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫아무튼 간에……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_30E84B6F_8F74_4AF0_ADDC_808EFDF1312A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87bdb26261a5a5ff601c92abad6a5eac5db266fce2c33b957fcc0c7cdb93ef80
#. default-sha256: fda2e4b761a9b9875cf9f6c67864a171f19d445fa4d4722309ef712329120138
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30E84B6F_8F74_4AF0_ADDC_808EFDF1312A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they are not equals in this endeavor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫세 남자는 ⟪k:3⟫대등한 관계가 아닙니다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d8d3e3b040c9e8d36f658979a464289e82ddb35407ec656352f3b6110b6b3bf
#. default-sha256: 5ac81cfd80da4029090dc9330bbd287609d01dcbf28b14d9bbdce1e7eb16736a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he wants out, then maybe he would have agreed to help if we told him we’re here "
"to save Morgana."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그럼 우리가 ⟪k:3⟫모르가나를 ⟪k:4⟫구하러 왔단 걸⟪k:5⟫설명하면 ⟪k:6⟫협력해 주지 않을"
"까요……?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0abb4f8d161a505aa5578aa31d2c76a16c4a67a73adf37eb8c269be26611cdc
#. default-sha256: ffa498e6bac12a0080931c1e7beb68ac87fef905dd117e3324561150dee40c83
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re right, we do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We know things we should have no way of knowing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫듣고 보니…… ⟪k:3⟫그렇네요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫우리한텐 원래는 몰라야 할 기억이 있죠."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76389663ed56b8ea19a67caffd679b7f053d2edc490f1d0b4b82033c2fb605e7
#. default-sha256: 77cf45464dfc1d2c3d6344ed733d3d64eaf26643fe01011136b5364b523daeb2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They each have their reasons for locking Morgana up,⟪k:3⟫and if I’m right, they’re "
"doing it for other people.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’s these powerful bonds driving them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫우선―― 인연이죠. ⟪k:3⟫남자들이 모르가나를 유폐한 데엔⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫각자 누군가를 위한"
"단 이유가 있던 것 같아요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e31605d89afed505a49f24fd906ff03b38e0f81d7230a844d596e431abdf489
#. default-sha256: 4eff8c3d43f205574e1a6d76dbe7e5da777ef5bf39587f410b4de82058fabbf4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Are they mere bonds, or is it fate that ties them together?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(……인연인지, ⟪k:2⟫인과인지……)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95D11894_E9D5_4C48_887C_518C2C448366
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 038de1944ed6c00826f3bc3b5066be7920ba7baec844042c0bcd14e8b633c190
