msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Morgana described it as “a tale that could have only taken place in that era of "
"miracles and spirituality,” and about that, she couldn’t be more right..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“기적과 신앙의 시대에서나 성립할 비극”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫――모르가나의 말은 ⟪k:5⟫옳습니다……."

