msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I assume the sickness was caused by them ingesting blood, at any rate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 사람들은⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫타인의 피를 마신 탓에 병에 걸린 걸 거예요."

