"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Putting ourselves out like that is only going to get us unwanted attention, make people "
"suspicious,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫함부로 눈에 띄게 굴면 ⟪k:2⟫괜한 의심을 살 테고――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_52D0D35B_4E69_4BC2_9144_232DE504DA02
