msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I understand the sentiment.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Or rather... ⟪k:5⟫I understand your reasoning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 마음은…… ⟪k:3⟫이해합니다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫아니……, ⟪k:6⟫그대가 그리 생각하는 바는 이해합"
"니다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_16DB0AF8_B439_4980_A82A_845FD7FEE04C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
