msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I turn my gaze back toward the nun to find her kneeling in one of the pews. She bows "
"her head and begins to whisper a prayer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫――시선을 수도녀에게로 되돌렸다. ⟪k:2⟫수도녀는 마침 ⟪k:3⟫의자에 앉아 ⟪k:4⟫기도문을 읊기 "
"시작한 상태였다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2986978C_E43C_442B_88FC_6123F26993B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
