msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hearing me approach, she falls silent and turns to face me, wearing her usual disarming "
"smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내가 다가가니 ⟪k:1⟫수도녀가 기도를 중단하고 나를 보았다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫여전히 ⟪k:4⟫누구나 마음을 "
"놓을 부드러운 미소를 지었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E422748E_8032_4A6E_BF75_08E11FC67868
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5dd323ee51e121ba80a50eca3acb4f4339c1b0bb1974ebbc3ab01913b749bb74
