msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(I can ask her about Saint’s Blood some other time...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And while I have a "
"number of questions about the man she’s close with too, right now, Mell’s sister is priority.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(성녀의 피 질문은 ⟪k:2⟫삼가자……. ⟪k:3⟫수도녀에게는 그 남자⟪k:4⟫ 질문도 하고 싶지만―― 지"
"금은 멜의 여동생이 먼저지)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_84D3B784_72D7_40D9_AB75_4D8AEB668B9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49a7acf2553f524e9534baff58ec6813474ab51c76b8809218caa8575e4be9b7
