msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Are you familiar... ⟪k:2⟫with Mell’s younger sister?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She has flaxen hair, much "
"like him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫멜에게…… 여동생이 있지 않습니까.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫멜처럼 아마빛 머리칼을 한――"

