msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그렇습니까……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ECA7378E_64FF_450A_AD1C_D8DAB050E4BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b39d5989717db8eaaec483831668897d7f14d27385d291aa1ee14decfbaa205
