msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’s the same building where the man who had been ordered to keep me under surveillance "
"stayed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫생전에 내 감시를 임명받은 자가 ⟪k:1⟫임시 거처로 쓰던 집이었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D94895D8_F41D_45D0_B982_DB07AECBB9ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7b256e692679cfc40df0d5230a27dc789d35cb167a5a97023caa024e4884508
