"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...I’ll be all right.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The sun’s past its peak. In a few hours, it won’t "
"be nearly as bad."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……당장은요. ⟪k:3⟫게다가 ⟪k:4⟫해도 저물기 시작했습니다.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫몇 시간 더 지나면 "
"⟪k:7⟫햇살도 나아질 겁니다."

