"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s not long before we reach a clearing, a small cottage surrounded by a "
"small garden coming into view."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫숲을 걷다 보니 ⟪k:4⟫머지않아 길이 트여――⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫작은 정원과 ⟪k:7⟫그 중심에 "
"세워진 오두막이 보이기 시작했다."

