msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Though several details of her appearance don’t match my memory of her, she still has "
"that distinct hair; ⟪k:2⟫it could be nobody else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫복장은 다르지만 ⟪k:2⟫포근한 아마빛 머리칼은 똑같았다. ⟪k:3⟫넬리인 건 틀림없겠는데――"

